            "   *  Tatsuhiro Tsujikawa",
            "",
            "   A portion of Mike Bishop's contribution was supported by Microsoft",
            "   during his employment there."
          ],
          "title": "Acknowledgments"
        },
        {
          "id": "name-index",
          "lines": [
            "   C D G H M P R S",
