            "            Section 7.2.5, Paragraph 4.2.1; Section 7.2.7, Paragraph 1;",
            "            Table 2; Appendix A.2.5, Paragraph 1.8.1",
            "         connection error  Section 2.2; Section 4.1, Paragraph 7;",
            "            Section 4.1, Paragraph 8; Section 4.4, Paragraph 8;",
