            "            Section 5.2, Paragraph 7; Section 6.1, Paragraph 3;",
            "            Section 6.2, Paragraph 7; Section 6.2.1, Paragraph 2;",
            "            Section 6.2.1, Paragraph 2; Section 6.2.1, Paragraph 2;",
