            "",
            "   [EXT-CONNECT3]",
            "              Hamilton, R., \"Bootstrapping WebSockets with HTTP/3\",",
            "              RFC 9220, DOI 10.17487/RFC9220, June 2022,",
            "              <https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc9220>.",
            "",
            "   [PRIORITY] Oku, K. and L. Pardue, \"Extensible Prioritization Scheme",
